      "value": "This is not a bug, it's a feature.\n\nThe social status of your profile does not change the discoverability of instances, it only hides the location from your profile.\n\nPublic, Group Public, Friends, Friends+, (Group+?) are discoverable from the Photon servers. If you don't want to be joinable and don't want an instance to be discoverable from the world list, make an Invite or Invite+ instance, or close the instance.\n\nDuplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/orange-status-requires-no-invite\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/friends-can-bypass-ask-me-status-through-world-menu\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/you-can-join-friends-when-they-are-in-friends-on-orange-red\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/ask-me-do-not-disturb-private-world",
