  "details": "hey guys iam confused, i was on a friends instance i created and was on orange. a friend of mine knew in which world i was and through that world list she saw my instance and was be able to join me without requesting. We tried this same again with another world she created this time with a friend instance and was on red. And through the worldlist i was also be able to join her without requesting. Is this a bug or did i miss something all these years? This should not be possible that u can join friends over the worldlist when u know in which world they are",
